      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{VIII} Gif hwa in cyninges healle gefeohte, oððe his wæpn gebrede, ⁊ hine mon gefó, sie ðæt on cyninges dome, swa deað swa lif, swa he him forgifan wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone fights in the king’s hall or draws his weapon, and he is caught, let it be according to the king’s judgment: either death or life, whichever the king wishes to grant him.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone fights or draws his weapon in the king's hall, and [if he] is arrested, it shall be for the king to decide whether he is to be put to death, or permitted to live, in case the king is willing to forgive him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">VIII. Gif hwa on kyninges healle gefeohte, oþþe wæpen gebrede, ⁊ hine mon gefó, sy ðæt on cyninges dóme, swa deað swa lif, swa he him forgyfan wille.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
